      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This book on RAMPs covers a number of aspects on the biology of RAMPs. However, due to the uniqueness of some recent studies, they were not covered under a general title. Therefore, in this chapter, we describe three recent studies wherein RAMPs were found to be important players in cancer, hypertension and asthma."},
